@title Standards findings are labelled in the Issues list (B-12)
@area Reports
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Ticking a standard adds its findings to the issue count; the window says so and the Issues list names the share.
open_starter_example
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Standards check
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
expect "adds its findings to the Issues list"
click_text "IEC 60204-1" #1
wait 10
shot standards-ticked
check_layout
key Escape
wait 3
click_text "errors" #1
wait 10
check_text 40
shot issues-standards-note
check_layout
